{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've awakened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in a mysterious world of floating islands, where the sky shimmers with an ethereal glow. The islands drift like fragmented dreams, surrounded by unfamiliar flora and an unknown ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You gradually adapt to this world's rules. You'll need to <strong>build a home and develop technology, starting from scratch</strong>\u2014from primitive tools to advanced machinery. <strong>Craft technological marvels, explore uncharted islands, and search for other survivors.</strong> Uncover the origin of this strange world, unravel the mystery of how you came to be here, and ultimately, <strong>find your way back home</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To stay updated, get the latest news, and chat directly with us, be sure to follow our official channels:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Community Hub</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Official Discord Server</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We're continuously expanding our feedback channels to make it even easier for you to share your thoughts and connect with us.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We'd love to connect with you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/c16c0d3125cc42bcc2b5deebf5867f65.avif?t=1772072375\" width=494 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;To get rich, first chop trees.&quot; You can acquire vast amounts of resources by gathering from resource points and opening resource chests. All resources are the fundamental fuel for civilization upgrades; without resource accumulation, development will be impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/8862b14f06e266f7680c526ddf4d4be9.poster.avif?t=1772072375\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/8862b14f06e266f7680c526ddf4d4be9.webm?t=1772072375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/8862b14f06e266f7680c526ddf4d4be9.mp4?t=1772072375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/0401a2b149aba1db15fe4b18f5e8fd7c.avif?t=1772072375\" width=494 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The growth of your home base relies on sound planning. You need to reasonably allocate your workforce and set production tasks, transforming raw resources into precision industrial goods. Plan efficient industrial zones, strategically lay out facilities to build a production network, and use the power of machinery to break through productivity bottlenecks, extending your tech tree into the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/b8c14bb2735ba8e4550733dff281184c.poster.avif?t=1772072375\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/b8c14bb2735ba8e4550733dff281184c.webm?t=1772072375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/b8c14bb2735ba8e4550733dff281184c.mp4?t=1772072375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/f38fa019e645e36c57a2e10dd9664bef.avif?t=1772072375\" width=494 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the floating isles, you\u2019re free to design and expand as you like. Shape barren land into a thriving skybound home\u2014complete with functional facilities, green spaces, and living quarters\u2014using nothing but your creativity and vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/9549392a495cfbcf8ab609c6d4da71e1.poster.avif?t=1772072375\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/9549392a495cfbcf8ab609c6d4da71e1.webm?t=1772072375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/9549392a495cfbcf8ab609c6d4da71e1.mp4?t=1772072375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/b221593ec5c1e5177fdfd69dfa6cc224.avif?t=1772072375\" width=494 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across the expanse of the floating isles,\u00a0dwellers discovered a rare mineral known as Mysterious Glowing Stone, which harbors immense energy within. By channeling the shimmering waves it emits into dormant mechanisms, they learned to awaken ancient machines\u2014setting them into motion and freeing humankind from manual labor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet this was only the first glimpse of the power within these waves. Greater mysteries await those who dare to harness them further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/fff61b6317478df15cc089ea51068b9f.poster.avif?t=1772072375\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/fff61b6317478df15cc089ea51068b9f.webm?t=1772072375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/fff61b6317478df15cc089ea51068b9f.mp4?t=1772072375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/0bab9c1466c6b5dab5e7fad5ad7dfe3c.avif?t=1772072375\" width=494 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is your character's movement speed too slow? Is their work efficiency too low?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't worry! You can enhance your character's abilities by wearing equipment and using idols, boosting their work efficiency and making every action quicker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/3e1601dbdc4553420b43e9d2615b0e74.poster.avif?t=1772072375\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/3e1601dbdc4553420b43e9d2615b0e74.webm?t=1772072375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/3e1601dbdc4553420b43e9d2615b0e74.mp4?t=1772072375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/d1634d321f66a99e7852d5646e3c724f.avif?t=1772072375\" width=494 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is vast and ripe for discovery. Venture into diverse regions, each a unique ecosystem teeming with exclusive resources and hidden opportunities. Every journey holds the promise of rare materials, lost technologies, and new frontiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/3bfcf7649641670e3bb6591df0e0d002.poster.avif?t=1772072375\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/3bfcf7649641670e3bb6591df0e0d002.webm?t=1772072375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/3bfcf7649641670e3bb6591df0e0d002.mp4?t=1772072375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All English text in the game was translated with the help of AI, so some lines might sound a little funky here and there. If you catch anything that makes you go \u201cwait, what?\u201d, feel free to swing by our Discord and let us know \u2014 your help might just save us from sounding like robots pretending to be human!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/04779dbf9a9c89a14b463bec9e829325.avif?t=1772072375\" width=494 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2134390?t=1772072375","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/1a805add93529588c84fc72f0a4a30e1cf780687/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772072375","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/5813dd63ce3cb9dd5d9bf24ab1522b391e8be69d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772072375","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/5813dd63ce3cb9dd5d9bf24ab1522b391e8be69d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772072375","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4015490,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Welcome Island</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join our Discord!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/7b938c36a0f9af3138353cb04338cf84.avif?t=1772072375\" width=494 height=140 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Early Access Content Preview</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/55fa5a645819e8745ae3a2e751ef598d.avif?t=1772072375\" width=494 height=1743 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/04779dbf9a9c89a14b463bec9e829325.avif?t=1772072375\" width=494 height=140 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've awakened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in a mysterious world of floating islands, where the sky shimmers with an ethereal glow. The islands drift like fragmented dreams, surrounded by unfamiliar flora and an unknown ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You gradually adapt to this world's rules. You'll need to <strong>build a home and develop technology, starting from scratch</strong>\u2014from primitive tools to advanced machinery. <strong>Craft technological marvels, explore uncharted islands, and search for other survivors.</strong> Uncover the origin of this strange world, unravel the mystery of how you came to be here, and ultimately, <strong>find your way back home</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To stay updated, get the latest news, and chat directly with us, be sure to follow our official channels:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Community Hub</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Official Discord Server</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We're continuously expanding our feedback channels to make it even easier for you to share your thoughts and connect with us.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We'd love to connect with you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/c16c0d3125cc42bcc2b5deebf5867f65.avif?t=1772072375\" width=494 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;To get rich, first chop trees.&quot; You can acquire vast amounts of resources by gathering from resource points and opening resource chests. All resources are the fundamental fuel for civilization upgrades; without resource accumulation, development will be impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/8862b14f06e266f7680c526ddf4d4be9.poster.avif?t=1772072375\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/8862b14f06e266f7680c526ddf4d4be9.webm?t=1772072375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/8862b14f06e266f7680c526ddf4d4be9.mp4?t=1772072375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/0401a2b149aba1db15fe4b18f5e8fd7c.avif?t=1772072375\" width=494 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The growth of your home base relies on sound planning. You need to reasonably allocate your workforce and set production tasks, transforming raw resources into precision industrial goods. Plan efficient industrial zones, strategically lay out facilities to build a production network, and use the power of machinery to break through productivity bottlenecks, extending your tech tree into the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/b8c14bb2735ba8e4550733dff281184c.poster.avif?t=1772072375\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/b8c14bb2735ba8e4550733dff281184c.webm?t=1772072375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/b8c14bb2735ba8e4550733dff281184c.mp4?t=1772072375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/f38fa019e645e36c57a2e10dd9664bef.avif?t=1772072375\" width=494 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the floating isles, you\u2019re free to design and expand as you like. Shape barren land into a thriving skybound home\u2014complete with functional facilities, green spaces, and living quarters\u2014using nothing but your creativity and vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/9549392a495cfbcf8ab609c6d4da71e1.poster.avif?t=1772072375\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/9549392a495cfbcf8ab609c6d4da71e1.webm?t=1772072375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/9549392a495cfbcf8ab609c6d4da71e1.mp4?t=1772072375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/b221593ec5c1e5177fdfd69dfa6cc224.avif?t=1772072375\" width=494 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across the expanse of the floating isles,\u00a0dwellers discovered a rare mineral known as Mysterious Glowing Stone, which harbors immense energy within. By channeling the shimmering waves it emits into dormant mechanisms, they learned to awaken ancient machines\u2014setting them into motion and freeing humankind from manual labor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet this was only the first glimpse of the power within these waves. Greater mysteries await those who dare to harness them further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/fff61b6317478df15cc089ea51068b9f.poster.avif?t=1772072375\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/fff61b6317478df15cc089ea51068b9f.webm?t=1772072375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/fff61b6317478df15cc089ea51068b9f.mp4?t=1772072375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/0bab9c1466c6b5dab5e7fad5ad7dfe3c.avif?t=1772072375\" width=494 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is your character's movement speed too slow? Is their work efficiency too low?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't worry! You can enhance your character's abilities by wearing equipment and using idols, boosting their work efficiency and making every action quicker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/3e1601dbdc4553420b43e9d2615b0e74.poster.avif?t=1772072375\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/3e1601dbdc4553420b43e9d2615b0e74.webm?t=1772072375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/3e1601dbdc4553420b43e9d2615b0e74.mp4?t=1772072375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/d1634d321f66a99e7852d5646e3c724f.avif?t=1772072375\" width=494 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is vast and ripe for discovery. Venture into diverse regions, each a unique ecosystem teeming with exclusive resources and hidden opportunities. Every journey holds the promise of rare materials, lost technologies, and new frontiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/3bfcf7649641670e3bb6591df0e0d002.poster.avif?t=1772072375\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/3bfcf7649641670e3bb6591df0e0d002.webm?t=1772072375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/3bfcf7649641670e3bb6591df0e0d002.mp4?t=1772072375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All English text in the game was translated with the help of AI, so some lines might sound a little funky here and there. If you catch anything that makes you go \u201cwait, what?\u201d, feel free to swing by our Discord and let us know \u2014 your help might just save us from sounding like robots pretending to be human!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/extras/04779dbf9a9c89a14b463bec9e829325.avif?t=1772072375\" width=494 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["XinZhi"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134390/3b5becda29ff1ada5182aee885948ae6e2c106b3/header.jpg?t=1772072375","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2134390/1209426868/d62ffccb37fe568685acb95de856d7f50f4f81d3/1760351021/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760410057","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2134390/1209426868/d62ffccb37fe568685acb95de856d7f50f4f81d3/1760351021/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760410057","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2134390/1209426868/d62ffccb37fe568685acb95de856d7f50f4f81d3/1760351021/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760410057","id":257155336,"name":"Gameplay Showcase","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257155336/a4c5d3a17207060d8f3879a5cc3d9cee49bbdfcf/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760410057"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2134390/982963333/302b0b783260feeb119c164909792ce2298e6ab6/1756188047/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756188783","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2134390/982963333/302b0b783260feeb119c164909792ce2298e6ab6/1756188047/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756188783","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2134390/982963333/302b0b783260feeb119c164909792ce2298e6ab6/1756188047/hls